{
  "_comment": [
    "CANONICAL cross-repo fixtures for the MeSH vocabulary fetchers — the surface that",
    "was on the 'not yet parity-checked' list until now.",
    "",
    "Same shape as parser-inputs.json, and for the same reason: these functions FETCH,",
    "so the only way to separate real divergence from an upstream difference is to feed",
    "byte-identical canned NLM payloads to both implementations.",
    "  - MCP app: server/mesh.ts (tests/unit/vocab-parity.test.ts, stubbing globalThis.fetch)",
    "  - Website: index.html's page globals meshVocabSearch / meshEntryTerms / meshScopeNote",
    "    (~/code/pubmedseed/tests/verify-parity.mjs, stubbing via page.route)",
    "",
    "Payloads are trimmed from real id.nlm.nih.gov responses captured 2026-07-29.",
    "",
    "`routes` matches on a substring of the REQUEST URL. All three SPARQL uses hit the",
    "same /mesh/sparql path, so they're discriminated by text inside the encoded query:",
    "  VALUES            -> entry-term -> descriptor resolution (meshVocabSearch)",
    "  broaderDescriptor -> hierarchy (broader/narrower)",
    "  scopeNote         -> the definition",
    "Order matters: the first matching route wins, so list the specific ones first.",
    "",
    "The expected outputs live in vocab-expected.json and are GENERATED by",
    "`npm run snapshot` — hand-writing a VocabRow[] would just be a third copy to",
    "maintain. Change a fetcher, regenerate, then make the website agree."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "search: a synonym resolves to its descriptor and reports the cross-reference",
      "fn": "meshVocabSearch",
      "arg": "heart attack",
      "routes": [
        { "urlContains": "lookup/term", "body": [
          { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T000866941", "label": "Heart Attack" }
        ] },
        { "urlContains": "lookup/descriptor", "body": [] },
        { "urlContains": "VALUES", "body": { "head": { "vars": ["t", "d", "dl"] }, "results": { "bindings": [
          {
            "t": { "type": "uri", "value": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T000866941" },
            "d": { "type": "uri", "value": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D009203" },
            "dl": { "type": "literal", "xml:lang": "en", "value": "Myocardial Infarction" }
          }
        ] } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "search: label matches rank first, and an entry term for an already-matched descriptor is dropped",
      "fn": "meshVocabSearch",
      "arg": "liver",
      "routes": [
        { "urlContains": "lookup/term", "body": [
          { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T024166", "label": "Liver" },
          { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T024165", "label": "Livers" }
        ] },
        { "urlContains": "lookup/descriptor", "body": [
          { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D065290", "label": "Acute-On-Chronic Liver Failure" },
          { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008099", "label": "Liver" },
          { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008107", "label": "Liver Cirrhosis" }
        ] },
        { "urlContains": "VALUES", "body": { "head": { "vars": ["t", "d", "dl"] }, "results": { "bindings": [
          {
            "t": { "type": "uri", "value": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T024166" },
            "d": { "type": "uri", "value": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008099" },
            "dl": { "type": "literal", "xml:lang": "en", "value": "Liver" }
          },
          {
            "t": { "type": "uri", "value": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T024165" },
            "d": { "type": "uri", "value": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008099" },
            "dl": { "type": "literal", "xml:lang": "en", "value": "Liver" }
          }
        ] } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "search: query shorter than two characters never hits the network",
      "fn": "meshVocabSearch",
      "arg": "l",
      "routes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "details: entry terms, broader/narrower split, and scope note",
      "fn": "meshVocabDetails",
      "label": "Liver",
      "id": "D008099",
      "routes": [
        { "urlContains": "lookup/details", "body": {
          "descriptor": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008099",
          "terms": [
            { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T024166", "label": "Liver", "preferred": true },
            { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T024165", "label": "Livers", "preferred": false }
          ]
        } },
        { "urlContains": "lookup/descriptor", "body": [
          { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008099", "label": "Liver" }
        ] },
        { "urlContains": "broaderDescriptor", "body": { "head": { "vars": ["dir", "label"] }, "results": { "bindings": [
          { "dir": { "type": "literal", "value": "n" }, "label": { "type": "literal", "xml:lang": "en", "value": "Bile Ducts, Intrahepatic" } },
          { "dir": { "type": "literal", "value": "b" }, "label": { "type": "literal", "xml:lang": "en", "value": "Digestive System" } },
          { "dir": { "type": "literal", "value": "n" }, "label": { "type": "literal", "xml:lang": "en", "value": "Round Ligament of Liver" } }
        ] } } },
        { "urlContains": "scopeNote", "body": { "head": { "vars": ["note"] }, "results": { "bindings": [
          { "note": { "type": "literal", "xml:lang": "en", "value": "A large lobed glandular organ in the abdomen of vertebrates that is responsible for detoxification, metabolism, synthesis and storage of various substances." } }
        ] } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "details: label NLM doesn't know degrades to empty rather than throwing",
      "fn": "meshVocabDetails",
      "label": "Not A Real Heading",
      "id": null,
      "routes": [
        { "urlContains": "lookup/descriptor", "body": [] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "details: no descriptor id means no scope-note query, but hierarchy still resolves",
      "fn": "meshVocabDetails",
      "label": "Liver",
      "id": null,
      "routes": [
        { "urlContains": "lookup/details", "body": {
          "descriptor": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008099",
          "terms": [
            { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T024166", "label": "Liver", "preferred": true },
            { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/T024165", "label": "Livers", "preferred": false }
          ]
        } },
        { "urlContains": "lookup/descriptor", "body": [
          { "resource": "http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008099", "label": "Liver" }
        ] },
        { "urlContains": "broaderDescriptor", "body": { "head": { "vars": ["dir", "label"] }, "results": { "bindings": [
          { "dir": { "type": "literal", "value": "b" }, "label": { "type": "literal", "xml:lang": "en", "value": "Digestive System" } }
        ] } } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
